      },
      {
        "id": "book033-b001593-p000-bed27a4122",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "此处为《地理人子须知》卷五下篇所记载的法度。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book033-b001594-p000-c97e13d492",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "砂为贵格上格，陈族仙群。案山正作宜群仙簇队之状，诸峰如森林般密集，旌旗簇拥重叠，上如峰屯，下如蚁聚，皆秀丽清奇之象，亦为三千粉黛、八百烟花富贵之象。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book033-b001596-p000-bdcce9ec12",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "上格龙脉主掌公侯国戚、驸马女妃及神仙；中格龙脉主镇大藩巨蜀，多仅从武贵；下格龙脉主出人风流飘荡。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book033-b001597-p000-4d43993d5d",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "银瓶盏筋，或有盏而无瓶，此则可假借为瓶山，亦自仿佛不指为瓶，则不过为贵秀之峰也。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book033-b001598-p000-00fa174b22",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "上格龙脉主贵，上殿捧献觞；中格龙脉主富，欧宾客满门。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book033-b001599-p000-b438c2b16a",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "木杓者，以其有似于木拘盖。今乞丐及化缘道人所带，不过微柄为穿孔击之所而已，故柄短者主乞丐。",
